  "description": "<p>This task is to create a new document in the fcrepo-adopters-guide <span class=\"error\">&#91;1&#93;</span> that details aspects of what would be required for existing clients to move from the current Fedora implementation of the Versioning feature to what has been defined in the fcrepo-specification <span class=\"error\">&#91;2&#93;</span>.<br/>\n<span class=\"error\">&#91;1&#93;</span> <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo-adopters-guide\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo-adopters-guide</a><br/>\n<span class=\"error\">&#91;2&#93;</span> <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo-specification\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo-specification</a></p>\n\n<p>See the messaging section as an example:<br/>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo-adopters-guide/blob/master/docs/messaging.md\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo-adopters-guide/blob/master/docs/messaging.md</a></p>",
